    "created_at": "2018-04-09T18:59:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-04-09T18:59:43Z",
    "body": "Sorry, upon re-reviewing the thread, let's scratch that suggestion. If everyone interoperably delays the load event for at least top-level `@import`s, we probably shouldn't move away from that.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/379858223/reactions",
